{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>行勻SHIBUYA SKY、Parco同各大古著店，最爽的回血方式不是回酒店休養，而是在燒肉店大口吃肉！看著粉嫩和牛放在烤網激起火花、肉汁順著油花滿溢，再大啖扒飯，逛街疲勞𣊬間治癒。今次為大家精選10間澀谷Tabelog高分燒肉名店，由預約困難的頂級和牛、爆汁厚切牛舌到深夜食堂統統有齊，今晚就好好犒賞自己吧～\n</p>\n<p>🩵留言「肉」Send澀谷精選燒肉店list &amp; 預約連結給你～</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299442091614317_20122775366adeec7594383.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179299442091614317_20122775366adeec7594383.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@tabelog_japanbylocals / 官方)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De8eDnvE9LY/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%be%80%e8%b0%b7%e7%87%92%e8%82%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">澀谷燒肉</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%be%80%e8%b0%b7%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">澀谷美食</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%82%ba%e9%a3%9f%e6%a6%9c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">為食榜</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@tabelog_japanbylocals / 官方資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/De8eDnvE9LY/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:37.508643+00:00","quality":{"s